Alternatively, we could create a struct like:

```c++
struct EnumInterface {
	String name;
	bool is_bitfield;
	List<Pair<String, int64_t>> values;
};
```

Then we'd only need one map:

```c++
HashMap<String, EnumInterface> enum_list;
```
